{"id":"b9be0506-280d-4f8f-aef4-3e083eb8b97a","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:21:48.622Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Berechne den Gesamtumfang der Figur. Die Maße kannst du dem Bild unten entnehmen. Runde dein Ergebnis auf eine Nachkommastelle."}]}],"id":"6c1b5ad6-15c4-4808-8df6-32afe3b4a6b0"},{"plugin":"image","state":{"src":"https://assets.serlo.org/5fe1c9ff68aab_fc18828ec25fe48afa6f8e097f879f9f69506314.svg","maxWidth":200,"caption":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"947552b2-6e51-465e-8000-b52cb3599afc"}},"id":"4b084c7a-70f5-451b-bf52-b1bb89d30279"}],"id":"0e446e65-aefd-441c-9de6-5c4014c06ce5"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"prerequisite":{"id":"36162","title":"Kreis"},"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{}]}],"id":"2185e036-1651-47fc-af75-33b9eb1d6965"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die allgemeine Formel zur Berechnung des "},{"type":"a","href":"1553","children":[{"text":"Kreisumfangs"}]},{"text":" ist:"}]}],"id":"a2a630e0-bfe9-4132-bcf1-f1bc4dc8ca3c"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"U_{\text{Kreis}} = 2\pi \cdot r","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"9a5b0b75-de5d-42e2-bbd3-2a34a4f95798"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Die Figur setzt sich aus dem blauen Kreis und dem weißen Halbkreis zusammen. Daraus folgt für den Gesamtumfang:"}]}],"id":"948fcd9c-6ee1-4232-a818-dcffee5d4d17"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
U_{\text{gesamt}} &=& U_{\text{weiß}} + U_{\text{blau}} \\
U_{\text{gesamt}} &=& \Big[\dfrac{1}{2}(2 \pi \cdot r) + d\Big] + 2 \pi \cdot r
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"23a59d2a-e6d4-40e4-a8f5-35e75901b004"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Vergiss nicht den Durchmesser zum Halbkreis hinzu zu addieren für die untere Linie, des Halbkreises. "}]}],"id":"7a47dc6f-eafe-4dab-9c41-1943d6656758"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Der Durchmesser "},{"type":"math","src":"d","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":" der beiden Kreise ist in der Zeichnung gegeben. Für die Formel brauchst du aber den Radius "},{"type":"math","src":"r","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":". Diesen kannst du wie folgt berechnen:"}]}],"id":"d2b59f09-62bc-46a9-a6d5-b35b1f27cd00"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
d = 2 \cdot r \Rightarrow r &=& \dfrac{1}{2} d \\\\
r &=& \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot 15 \,\text{cm} = 7,5 \,\text{cm}
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"a38fadc9-32ba-4718-a91d-3ad749e0058f"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nun brauchst du nur noch die gegebenen Werte einzusetzen."}]}],"id":"7f0fa832-9305-4480-9735-a8ba4cc48eef"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{rcl}
U_{\text{gesamt}} &=& \Big[\dfrac{1}{2}(2 \pi \cdot r) + d\Big] + 2 \pi \cdot r \\\\
U_{\text{gesamt}} &=& \Big[\dfrac{1}{2}(2\pi \cdot 7,5 \,\text{cm}) + 15 \,\text{cm}\Big] + 2 \pi \cdot 7,5 \,\text{cm} \\\\
U_{\text{gesamt}} &\approx& 85,7 \,\text{cm}
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"966e1562-9220-4595-b1c1-71e2a7a05c1a"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Das heißt, dass der Gesamtumfang ca. 85,7 cm beträgt."}]}],"id":"e7542de8-a3b8-4656-9ead-3f884a622d73"}],"id":"8f243dda-59ed-42a2-9975-d71b53834cb2"}},"id":"ea15c03d-a1be-4e86-9bf0-c8b9d8583b12"}},"id":"dbe4491d-b192-400e-81ea-f159f8c2d3b0"}}
